  "body": "## Summary\n\nFixes the pipeline-templates lint failures that surfaced on the previous lockfile cleanup PR:\n\n- **YAML Extensions** — workflow files renamed `.yml` → `.yaml`. Pipeline-templates standardizes on `.yaml` (Helm requires `Chart.yaml` / `values.yaml` exactly; the k8s ecosystem emits `.yaml` by default).\n- **Trailing Newlines** — added to flagged files (`.github/dependabot.yml`, `README.md`, etc.).\n\n## Still failing after this (lint-template bugs)\n\n- `.github/dependabot.yml` flagged by YAML Extensions. GitHub's docs only mention `dependabot.yml`; the safer move is to exclude it in the lint template rather than risk renaming and breaking Dependabot.\n- `Filename Underscores` flags Python module files (plant-agent) and training asset paths (kill-me) that have legitimate underscores.\n\nFollow-up PR going up against [nelsong6/pipeline-templates](https://github.com/nelsong6/pipeline-templates) to widen those exclusion lists.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
